              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{3}+4\\pi k;\\frac{5\\pi}{3}+4\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:43:01.405902+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"ebb0b143-d49c-4e35-a6b2-9ccc6a1ce37b\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>а)  Под зна­ка­ми обоих ра­ди­ка­лов на­хо­дят­ся пол­ные квад­ра­ты:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\sin^{2} 0{,}5x+2\\sin 0{,}5x+1}-\\sqrt{(4\\sin 0{,}5x-6)^{2}}=-2{,}5\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left|\\sin \\frac{x}{2}+1\\right|-\\left|4\\sin \\frac{x}{2}-6\\right|=-\\frac{5}{2}\\underset{\\sin \\alpha+1\\ge 0}{\\iff}\\left|4\\sin \\frac{x}{2}-6\\right|=\\sin \\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{7}{2}\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}4\\sin \\frac{x}{2}-6=\\sin \\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{7}{2}\\\\4\\sin \\frac{x}{2}-6=-\\sin \\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}3\\sin \\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{19}{2}\\gt 3{,}5\\sin \\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\sin \\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\\\\\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in \\mathbb{Z}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}+4\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{5\\pi}{3}+4\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p><p><span></span></p><p></p><p></p></center><p>б)  Отберём корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти. Под­хо­дит  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
