            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:20:23.097289+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{1-\\cos^{2} x}+\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x=0\"></span>.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\pi;\\frac{\\pi}{2}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:20:23.097289+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k,\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:20:23.097289+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ис­поль­зу­ем ос­нов­ное три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ское тож­де­ство:<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{1-\\cos^{2} x}=\\sqrt{\\sin^{2} x}=\\left|\\sin x\\right|\"></span>,</p></center><p>тогда урав­не­ние при­ни­ма­ет вид</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\left|\\sin x\\right|+\\sqrt{3}\\left(1-2\\sin^2 x\\right)=0\\Leftrightarrow \\left|\\sin x\\right|+\\sqrt{3}-2\\sqrt{3}\\sin^2 x=0\\Leftrightarrow 6\\left|\\sin^2 x\\right| -\\sqrt{3}\\left|\\sin x\\right|-3=0.\"></span></span></p></center><p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left|\\sin x\\right|=t\"></span>, тогда</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"6t^{2}-\\sqrt{3}\\cdot t-3=0\\iff t=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\pm \\sqrt{3-4\\cdot 6\\cdot (-3)}}{12}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}t=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\\\t=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"056d896b-1dd8-40a2-99b2-cee586b7670a\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>Вернёмся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\left|\\sin x\\right|=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\\\\\left|\\sin x\\right|=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left|\\sin x\\right|=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\sin x=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\\\\\sin x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff x=\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </span></p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">С по­мо­щью чис­ло­вой окруж­но­сти от­бе­рем корни, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\pi;\\frac{\\pi}{2}]\"></span> .  По­лу­чим числа:  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
